@baseUrl = http://localhost:7072
@apiKey = SET_LOCALLY
@graphToken = SET_LOCALLY
@jobId = 00000000000000000000000000000000

### Public dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Aggregate health and bounded sample history
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Diagnostics
GET {{baseUrl}}/diag

### Sanitized sample CSV
GET {{baseUrl}}/diag/log

### Baked inventory
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/inventory
X-Functions-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Start a delegated scan (add optional app credential headers locally)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/maester
X-Functions-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{graphToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"suites":["maester"],"severity":["Critical","High"],"includeLongRunning":false,"includePreview":true}

### Poll; the same completed result can be read repeatedly until expiry
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/maester?jobId={{jobId}}
X-Functions-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Invalid identifier
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/maester?jobId=invalid
X-Functions-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Unauthorized request
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/inventory

### Development-only OpenAPI
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json